===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|is|da|nul||nobody}}, from {{der|is|it|nullo||no, not any; null}} '''or''' {{der|is|fr|nul||no, no one}}, from {{der|is|frm|nul||nobody; no one}}, from {{der|is|fro|nul||nobody; no one}}, '''both''' from {{der|is|la|nūllus||no one, none, not any}}, from {{der|is|itc-pro||*ne oinolos}}, from {{der|is|itc-pro|*oinos||one}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*óynos}}, perhaps from {{m|ine-pro|*éy||he, she, it}} + {{m|ine-pro|*-nós|pos=creates verbal adjectives}}.<ref>{{R:is:Íslensk orðsifjabók|page=676}}</ref>

